Screen Open 0,640,200,4,Hires : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Trap Set Font 1 : Print #1,Errtrap
Get Rom Fonts : N=0 : While Font$(N+1)<>"" : Inc N : Print #1,Font$(N) : Wend
Set Font 1 : Ink 1 : Text 10,20,"Rom font 1"
Set Font 2 : Ink 2 : Text 10,40,"Rom font 2"
Trap Set Font 99 : Print #1,Errtrap
Set Font 0 : Ink 3 : Text 10,60,"System font"
For I=1 To N : Set Font I : Ink 1+(I mod 3) : Text 10,70+I*18,Font$(I) : Next I
Get Rom Fonts : F=0 : While Font$(F+1)<>"" : Inc F : Wend : Print #1,F=N
Set Font 1 : Text 330,20,"Again 1" : Set Font 0 : Text 330,40,"Again 0"
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/fonts_1.iff"
Screen Open 1,320,200,4,Lowres : Curs Off : Cls 0 : Ink 1 : Text 10,20,"New screen"
Screen Close 1 : Text 330,60,"Back" : Set Font 2 : Text 330,80,"Font 2 again"
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/fonts_2.iff"
Print #1,"end"
